p":"changed","opLabel":{"$i18n":"history.diff.op.changed"}},"id":"pointer-d-changed","type":"DiffItem"},{"config":{"after":"./dist/extra.css","label":"/styles/1","op":"added","opLabel":{"$i18n":"history.diff.op.added"}},"id":"pointer-d-added","type":"DiffItem"},{"config":{"before":"design-system","label":"/components/badge/layer","op":"removed","opLabel":{"$i18n":"history.diff.op.removed"}},"id":"pointer-d-removed","type":"DiffItem"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"RootShell"},"name":"Changes since Git base","spec":{"accessibility":["The base toggle is a group named Git base with its selected option exposed; a blocked option says why in text, never only by being dimmed.","Each changed resource names its status, kind and name in words, and each difference names its operation in words, so color is never the only signal; the Git failure is announced as an alert.","Images carry alternative text that names the Asset."],"constraints":["Built only from Adapter Widgets (Stack, Text, Icon, Button, SegmentedControl, Segment, ListItem, DiffItem, Image, Alert, EmptyState, Skeleton); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","The strings of the app are copied under the same Locale keys where one exists (history.compare.*, history.kind.*, history.diff.*). The panel's own strings (title, base toggle, notes, the Git failure and the empty state) are English literals until issue #492 builds the panel and adds their Locale keys: a Locale change stales every formal capture, so this change adds none. Resource names, diff values and member nicknames are sample content.","The Image Widgets bind the dogfood Workspace image Asset test-icon on both sides, because a View binds one Asset revision: the real panel shows the base and the current content of the Asset.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A member opened the history side panel of a View's page, which every layout offers, or the Activity tab of the Overview; the panel is read-only and works without any permission key beyond reading the Workspace.","The base state compares the working tree with HEAD, so uncommitted changes are listed: three resources changed (a modified View, an added View and a removed Locale) and the modified View is selected, with its differences shown. Variants show the merge-base option, a repository with no default branch, Git that cannot supply the base, no changes and the differences of each kind of resource.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the Workbench chrome follows the Workbench language, so its text is baked here per Locale. Resource names, Widget IDs, values and member nicknames are sample content."],"intent":"Show the read-only Changes since Git base panel as built from Adapter Widgets only: the canonical resources added, changed or removed since a Git base, the base toggle between HEAD and the merge base, and the semantic differences of the selected resource. A View's page offers it as a history side panel for that View; Overview: Activity shows the same list for the whole Workspace.","interactionRules":["The panel lists each canonical resource that is added, changed or removed since the base: its status, its kind and its name. Selecting a row shows what changed in that resource as semantic differences between its content at the base and its current content: properties, Widgets, bindings, Variants and Spec of a View, the steps of a Flow, the messages of a Locale, the settings of the Workspace, an Asset's content, or the changed JSON pointers when a resource has no richer form.","The base is HEAD and the current content is the working tree. A toggle changes the base to the merge base of HEAD and the repository's default branch; the current content stays the working tree.","When no default branch can be determined, the merge-base option is unavailable and HEAD stays the base.","When git cannot supply the base, the panel says so and lists nothing, with Retry; the rest of the Workbench keeps working.","The panel offers no action that writes, restores or reverts a resource. It reads the base content through the git CLI and stores nothing."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the four core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"label":"P1: Version history is Git's (Discussion #491), owner acceptance","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/491#discussioncomment-19699447"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"f6a2d104-8b3c-4d4e-9f50-6a7b8c9d0e04"}],"requirements":["01a11a5e-1aa5-7d13-939a-8d99245f7906","01a11a5e-1b52-7f6f-8244-65bb038ef6f8","01a1ece7-8e23-77a8-9f34-b9c479043ca8","01a1ece7-8f2f-7565-a11f-6d5ac9b5bab3","01a1ece7-8fe1-7d17-8ef4-c706259e5331","01a1ece7-91a3-709c-830d-42ff0393217a"]},"variants":{"diff-bindings-as-references":{"requirements":["01a1ece7-8f2f-7565-a11f-6d5ac9b5bab3"],"state":{"bindings-sec-widgets":{"visible":true},"diff-properties":{"visible":false},"diff-spec":{"visible":false},"diff-variants":{"visible":false},"diff-widgets":{"visible":false}}},"diff-collapsed":{"requirements":["01a1ece7-8f2f-7565-a11f-6d5ac9b5bab3"],"state":{"article-view-body":{"visible":false},"article-view-head-chevron-closed-i":{"visible":true},"article-view-head-chevron-open-i":{"visible":false}}},"diff-image-asset":{"requirements":["01a1ece7-8f2f-7565-a11f-6d5ac9b5bab3"],"state":{"article-asset":{"visible":true},"article-flow":{"visible":false},"article-locale":{"visible":false},"article-pointer":{"visible":false},"article-settings":{"visible":false},"article-view":{"visible":false},"summary-added":{"visible":false},"summary-asset":{"selected":true,"visible":true},"summary-